        "routine_id": "calibrate_xy",
        "controller_role": "builder_board",
        "source": "firmware/main.ino",
        "protocol": "Serial commands: SET XY PINS, SET XY LIMITS, CALIBRATE XY <xCm> <speedRpm> <trapezoidFlag> <accelerationRpmPerSecond> <stepsPerRotation> <maxProbeRotations>. Firmware probes X min then X max and records measured X steps per centimeter.",
